abstract: >
  VIGIL Observatory is CAM Initiative's Incident-centred public observatory and
  failure-taxonomy publication system for AI-governance evidence and occurrence-level
  diagnosis. The technical VIGIL namespace is retained for repository paths, schemas,
  record identifiers, and machine-readable artefacts.
